    "long_instructions": "## **Test a Sensor**\r\n\r\nTest a prototype sensor panel before it goes into a real app.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Try every sensor on the Sensor Panel. Use each one more than once.\r\n2. Watch the phone after every change. What changes? What stays the same?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**Discuss:**\r\n* Which sensors would a real phone use *on its own*, without you doing anything?\r\n* Which ones needed *you* to do something first?\r\n"
  },
  "published": true,
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 19:39:17 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 19:39:18 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 19:39:45 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"require_edit_to_continue\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 19:43:49 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 19:45:45 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 19:51:37 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 19:54:19 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"long_instructions\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 20:00:12 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"long_instructions\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 20:00:32 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"long_instructions\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-09-24 20:52:06 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"}]"
